## 3. Complete 12-Module Eurorack Lineup (v4 Upgrades Highlighted)

### Row 1: Master Multi-Pattern Beat & Clock Foundation (Top of Stack)

1. **`01 // X0X UNDERTONE SEQUENCER` (4-Pattern $\times$ 4-Bar $\times$ 4-Track Master Pulse Engine):**
   * **4 Selectable Pattern Banks (`PAT A` | `PAT B` | `PAT C` | `PAT D`):**
     * Tap any pattern bank to switch patterns cleanly at the next bar boundary (or immediately when paused).
     * **`CHAIN` Mode (`A→B→C→D`):** Automatically advances through active patterns at the end of each pattern's bar length for evolving 4-part dub arrangements.
   * **Selectable Bar Lengths (`1 BAR` [16 steps] | `2 BARS` [32 steps] | `4 BARS` [64 steps]):**
     * **Bar Page Selector (`B1` | `B2` | `B3` | `B4`):** View and edit 16 steps per page.
     * **`AUTO-FOLLOW` Toggle:** Automatically flips the visible page (`B1 → B2 → B3 → B4`) as the playhead traverses multi-bar sequences.
     * **`COPY B1→ALL` Utility:** Instantly duplicates Bar 1 across Bars 2–4 so you can sculpt subtle end-of-phrase fills on Bar 4.
   * **Polyrhythmic Per-Track Step Length (`LEN: 4–16`):**
     * Each of the 4 tracks (`01 SUB KICK`, `02 DUB RIM`, `03 DUST HAT`, `04 WOOD TOM`) features an independent step-length selector (`4–16`), allowing e.g. an 11-step Wood Tom or 13-step Dust Hat to cycle polyrhythmically against a 16-step Sub Kick.
   * **Per-Track Controls:** Tap track label to **Audition & Select Voice** in Module 02, **`M`** (Mute), **`LNK`** (Normalled internal trigger connection to the Analog Beat Synth), plus **`DUB GROOVE`**, **`MINIMAL`**, and **`CLEAR`** pattern generators.
   * **Patch Outputs:**
     * `TRK 1 TRG`, `TRK 2 TRG`, `TRK 3 TRG`, `TRK 4 TRG` (individual track step triggers).
     * `STEP CLK` (emits a trigger on every active beat step, ideal for driving `03 // EUCLIDEAN & CLOCK` or `08 // SLOW LFO & CHAOS`).
     * `BAR 1 TRG` (emits a reset/sync trigger on Step 1 of Bar 1 of the pattern cycle).

2. **`02 // ANALOG BEAT SYNTH` (4-Voice Full-Synthesizer Percussion Engine + Envelope Follower):**
   * **Independent Full-Synth Architecture Per Voice (`01 KICK`, `02 RIM`, `03 HAT`, `04 TOM`):**
     * **Oscillator & FM Section:** Selectable waveforms (`SIN`, `TRI`, `SAW`, `SQR`), `OSC FREQ` ($28\text{–}900\text{ Hz}$), `P-ENV/FM` pitch/FM sweep depth, `P-DECAY` ($8\text{–}450\text{ ms}$), and `NOISE MIX` ($0\text{–}100\%$).
     * **Multimode Resonant Filter:** Selectable filter topology (`LP`, `BP`, `HP`) with `FILT CUT` ($45\text{–}14000\text{ Hz}$), `FILT RES` ($0.5\text{–}16\text{ Q}$), bipolar `FILT ENV` ($-4500\text{ to }+6500\text{ Hz}$), plus external **`FILT CV` (`beats:filtCv`)** modulation input.
     * **Full ADSR Amplitude Envelope & Saturation:** `SAT DRIVE` tube waveshaper + complete **`ATTACK`**, **`DECAY`**, **`SUSTAIN`**, and **`RELEASE`** envelope stages.
   * **Patch Inputs:** `KICK IN`, `RIM IN`, `HAT IN`, `TOM IN` (triggers), `PTCH CV`, and `FILT CV`.
   * **Patch Outputs:** Isolated voice audio outputs (`KICK`, `RIM`, `HAT`, `TOM`), summed `MIX OUT`, and **`ENV CV`** (envelope-follower CV output that pulses with every kick/rim/tom hit).

### Row 2: Beat-Synced Time Generators, Harmonic Swarm, Noise Lab & ZDF Filtering

3. **`03 // EUCLIDEAN & TIME DIVIDER` (Beat-Step Synced Clock & Multi-Bar Divider):**
   * **Clock Source Mode (`INT BPM` vs `EXT BEAT STEP`):**
     * In **`INT BPM`** mode, advances on the master $1/16\text{th}$ clock ($30\text{–}130\text{ BPM}$) and resets cleanly on `xox:barTrig` or `clock:resetIn`.
     * In **`EXT STEP`** mode, advances **only when a trigger arrives at `clock:stepIn`**—allowing any X0X drum lane (e.g., `TRK 2 DUB RIM` or `TRK 4 WOOD TOM`) to clock the Euclidean rhythm generator directly!
   * **Live Geometric Euclidean Ring (`<canvas>`):** Visualizes step positions, Euclidean polygon geometry, and active playhead rotation (`STEPS A`, `HITS A`, `HITS B`, `HUMANIZE`).
   * **Patch Inputs:** `STEP IN` (external beat-step advance trigger) and `RESET IN` (phase/step 1 reset trigger).
   * **Patch Outputs:** `EUCLID A`, `EUCLID B`, `DIV /4` (quarter-note/bar pulse), and **`2/4 BAR`** (ultra-slow multi-bar divider output for triggering long drone shifts or thunder strikes every 2 or 4 bars).

4. **`04 // HARMONIC DRONE BANK` (4-VCO Analog Swarm + Dual Subs):**
   * **Voicing Modes:** `UNISON`, `5TH+OCT`, `MIN 7`, `MIN 9`.
   * **Controls:** `BASE FREQ` ($32\text{–}165\text{ Hz}$), `DRIFT / DET` ($0\text{–}35\text{ cents}$), `SUB -1/-2` level ($-1\text{ Oct}$ sine + $-2\text{ Oct}$ triangle), `WAVE FOLD`, `FM INDEX`, and `SWARM LVL`.
   * **Patch Jacks:** `PITCH`, `FM CV`, `SPREAD` inputs; `SUB OUT` and `DRONE` audio outputs.

5. **`05 // TEXTURA NOISE LAB` (Multi-Spectrum Noise & Vinyl Dust):**
   * **Noise Colors:** `WHITE`, `PINK` ($-3\text{ dB/oct}$), `BROWN` ($-6\text{ dB/oct}$ deep rumble), and `TAPE HISS`.
   * **Controls:** `FORMANT` resonant bandpass frequency, `RESONANCE`, `VINYL DUST` crackle density, `TAPE HISS`, `WIDTH`, and `NOISE LVL`.
   * **Patch Jacks:** `FORM CV`, `VCA CV` inputs; `DUST TRG` and `NOISE` audio output.

6. **`06 // ZDF ANALOG FILTER` (Multimode Ladder Filter & Tube Drive):**
   * **Filter Modes:** `LP 24dB`, `LP 12dB`, `BANDPASS`, `NOTCH`.
   * **Controls:** `CUTOFF` ($35\text{–}9500\text{ Hz}$ logarithmic), `RESONANCE` ($0.5\text{–}16\text{ Q}$), pre-filter `SAT DRIVE`, bipolar `FM 1 ATTEN` & `FM 2 ATTEN` ($-100\%$ to $+100\%$), and `FILT LVL`.
   * **Patch Jacks:** `AUDIO IN`, `FM 1 CV`, `FM 2 CV` inputs; `FILT OUT` audio output.

### Row 3: Vactrol Sub-Pulse, Beat-Triggered LFO/Chaos, Mangling FX & Dub Space Mixer

7. **`07 // VACTROL SUB-PULSE` (Organic Low-Pass-Gate Bass Pulse):**
   * **Controls:** `SUB PITCH`, `PUNCH DROP`, `VACTROL DEC` ($80\text{ ms}\text{ to }1.8\text{ s}$), `LPG WARMTH`, `WOOD SNAP`, `PULSE LVL`, plus manual `● PING` trigger button.
   * **Patch Jacks:** `TRIG IN`, `PITCH CV`, `DECAY CV` inputs; `PULSE` audio output.

8. **`08 // SLOW LFO & CHAOS` (Beat-Triggered Phase-Reset LFOs & Stepped S&H):**
   * **Controls:** `LFO 1 HZ` ($0.02\text{–}4.0\text{ Hz}$ sine), `LFO 2 HZ` ($0.04\text{–}8.0\text{ Hz}$ triangle), and `CHAOS SLEW` (Lorenz-inspired random walk + Sample & Hold slew rate).
   * **New Beat-Trigger Patch Inputs:**
     * **`LFO RST` (`mod:lfoResetIn`):** Receiving any trigger (such as `xox:barTrig` or `xox:trig1`) hard-resets LFO 1 & LFO 2 phase to zero, locking slow sweeps to the beat.
     * **`S&H TRG` (`mod:shTrigIn`):** When patched, advances `SLEW S&H` and steps `CHAOS` **only when triggered by the connected beat track** (instead of the default $1/8\text{th}$ internal clock).
   * **Patch Outputs:** `LFO 1`, `LFO 2`, `CHAOS`, and `SLEW S&H`.

9. **`09 // WAVEFOLD & LO-FI FX` (Beat & Drone Mangling Processor):**
   * **Controls:** `WAVEFOLD`, `BIT CRUSH`, `TONE FILT`, `FILT RES`, bipolar `CV DEPTH`, and `FX MIX`.
   * **Patch Jacks:** `AUDIO IN`, `TONE CV`, `FOLD CV` inputs; `FX OUT` audio output.

10. **`10 // DUB TAPE DELAY` (Multi-Head Stereo Echo):**
    * **Controls:** `TAPE TIME`, `FEEDBACK` (up to $94\%$), `TAPE DAMP`, `WOW/FLUT`, `HEAD PAN`, and `ECHO WET`.
    * **Patch Jacks:** `AUDIO IN`, `TIME CV`, `FBACK CV` inputs; `TAPE OUT` audio output.

11. **`11 // SPACE & TAPE MIXER` (4-Channel Sidechain Mixer, Cavernous Reverb & Master Saturator):**
    * **Controls:** `CH 1 (DRONE)`, `CH 2 (BEAT)`, `CH 3 LVL`, `CH 4 (ECHO)`, `CAVERN REV`, and **`BEAT PUMP`** (sidechain ducking depth driven automatically by the Master Beat Engine on Channels 1 & 4).
    * **Master Chain:** Silk/Harsh smoothing low-pass filter $\rightarrow$ Reel-to-reel `WaveShaper` tape saturation $\rightarrow$ Dynamics Compressor/Limiter $\rightarrow$ Master Output Gain & Top-Bar Oscilloscope.

